  lines:
  - english: I captured this Pigfire, it was angry in the form of a Blazing-type
      malicious spirit!
    french: "J'ai captur\xE9 ce Pigfire, il \xE9tait f\xE2ch\xE9 sous la forme d'un
      esprit malveillant de type Blazing!"
  - english: I could have captured it by encountering a Demonic spirit, because every
      Spirimonz has two types!
    french: J'aurais pu le capturer en tombant sur un esprit Demonic car chaque Spirimonz
      ont deux types !
